  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Goz-AR v1.0 is an Augmenter Reality game demo, developed in Unity with
    AR-Foundation / AR-Core and built for Android.\n\n---\n\nIt was supposed to be
    a completely different / much lamer project. Luckily, I managed to keep my code
    and let the lamers sink in their own flatulence.\n\n---\n\nIndeed this is not
    a complete game but just a demo to showcase current AR capabilities. \nIt is
    my first PlayStore publication. Please ... be gentle with me :)\n\nIf you have
    any suggestions for improvement or complaints or whatever, email me.\n\nIf you
    wish to participate in further developments of this or any next project, email
    me.\n\nIf you feel like you have an idea for the next 1 Billion Dollar mobile
    game, email me.\n\nMy email:   pepposmart@gmail.com \nMy GitHub:   ...\n\nSpecial
    thanks to Lele & Max.\n"
